  "historicalEvidenceUntouched": true,
  "resolutions": [
    "The new React test used a Playwright-only exact option; removed that unsupported test option.",
    "Two older mocked tool APIs were updated to expose the quiet-state-guarded drop catalog; production guards were retained.",
    "OCR/QR form screenshots now supply one file. Multi-input entry still retains all files and requires explicit file choice, covered by the context integration suite.",
    "The primary JPG suggestion now uses the Figma To JPG/keeps-location label, while generic registry conversion still exposes all supported formats.",
    "One preview capture overlapped a production rebuild and failed on missing old asset URLs. The failure was retained; final captures run against a frozen, manifest-matched build.",
    "Earlier build/capture attempts are preserved; only manifest-matched final captures support this task."
  ]
}
